    {
     "q": "Why are there no named clients on this page?",
     "a": "Many pharmaceutical and biotech clients do not allow suppliers to name them, and we publish a case study only with written approval and a signed report behind every figure. Where a client cannot be named, the case study describes it by segment and province. A reference call can go further than a public page, because the client speaks for itself."
