    },
    {
     "q": "Are the figures from your tests or from the client?",
     "a": "FAT figures are ours, measured in our test bay on its feed water. SAT and OQ figures are measured on your feed water at your site, against protocols your quality unit approved. PQ data belongs to the client and is published only with its approval, labelled as client data. Each figure names the report it comes from."
    },
    {
     "q": "Can we witness another client's FAT?",
     "a": "Only with that client's permission, and usually under a non-disclosure agreement. [Confirm whether Aquemi offers witnessing of other clients' FATs, and on what terms.] If none can be arranged, we walk you through a redacted FAT protocol and report, and you witness your own FAT against a protocol you approved."
    },
